00:14:19.586 --> 00:14:21.460
With a distributed
database, because once you

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.500
shard the data globally,
one of the things

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.120
that we don't want
you to do is to use

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.304
a monotonically increasing ID.

00:14:27.304 --> 00:14:29.470
So that traditional long
