00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:20.550
to understand what's happened.

00:24:20.550 --> 00:24:22.320
Remember, this is all
about online telemetry,

00:24:22.320 --> 00:24:23.444
what's happening right now.

00:24:23.444 --> 00:24:26.010
And you'll see the emergent
behavior of your system

00:24:26.010 --> 00:24:26.700
in the patterns.

00:24:26.700 --> 00:24:28.290
You don't need to
and nor should you

00:24:28.290 --> 00:24:31.094
want to capture every single
request of every single node

00:24:31.094 --> 00:24:32.010
in the logging system.

00:24:32.010 --> 00:24:34.110
