00:26:05.484 --> 00:26:07.150
In tracing parlance,
you have the trace,

00:26:07.150 --> 00:26:10.420
which is the aggregate journey
of all the requests going

00:26:10.420 --> 00:26:14.297
from A to Z. From A to B to C to
D, that whole thing is called--

00:26:14.297 --> 00:26:15.130
it's just one trace.

00:26:15.130 --> 00:26:16.630
You have one trace ID.

00:26:16.630 --> 00:26:18.747
Each hop in the journey,
each leg of the journey,

00:26:18.747 --> 00:26:19.455
is called a span.

00:26:19.455 --> 00:26:22.636
So you have multiple span
IDs and one trace ID.

